codex
The experiment ran to its valid terminal state: `BROKEN_DOCKER_DAEMON`.

- Docker remained unreachable after the required 120-second recovery poll.
- Docker Desktop was unavailable, and stale CLI plugin repairs were sandbox-blocked.
- Per protocol, 0/12 executions were attempted and the timed section never started.
- No verification PNG was generated because the verifier correctly did not run.
- Offline contract tests passed for exact streams, 10,000 records, independent byte-identical references, and 1200×700 PNG generation.

Artifacts:

- [results.json](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/results.json)
- [preflight report](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/preflight/report.json)
- [experiment.py](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/experiment.py)
- [verify.py](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/verify.py)
- [provision_image.py](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/provision_image.py)
- [test_protocol.py](/Users/gdeml/git/researchAI/projects/topic-can-make-reproduce-be-run-from-a-fresh-iso/workspace/test_protocol.py)

Once Docker is available, package an already-local suitable image with `provision_image.py`, then rerun `.venv/bin/python experiment.py`.
